The first recording contains an infant-cry-like sound.
The profile evidence points to Demo Baby.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:15,000
The ranker searches only this profile's history.
Cry pattern and time of day are the active factors.

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:21,000
The app waits for five additional grounded confirmations,
seven recordings, and at least 20 analyzed seconds.

5
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:29,000
Observed latch at 21 seconds.
What helped before: turned on white noise.

6
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:38,000
Two synthetic history incidents support the suggestion,
and both record a settled outcome.

7
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:45,000
The caregiver remains in control of what to try.
The app does not diagnose a cause.
